    "Before updating your outline to this version’s format, Flowie saves a copy of it, and that failed. Nothing was changed. Make sure this device has free space, then open Flowie again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before updating your outline to this version’s format, Flowie saves a copy of it, and that failed. Nothing was changed. Make sure this device has free space, then open Flowie again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把大纲升级到这个版本的格式之前，Flowie 要先保存一份副本，但保存失败了。大纲没有任何改动。请确认设备有可用空间，然后重新打开 Flowie。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
